// "Replace all instances of one <sort> word with another": a color word or a
// land type word, used as one [CR#612.2]. An absent word is one the performer
// chooses.
//
// STOP (owner ruling wanted). One row is one sort, so Mind Bend and Trait
// Doctoring ("one color word with another OR one basic land type with
// another") have no single row: the sort is chosen as the effect applies, not
// as the spell is cast. And Magical Hack, Sleight of Mind, Alter Reality,
// Glamerdye and Crystal Spray target a "spell or permanent", which the
// checker refuses as a cross-zone disjunction (`badSpellOrPermanentSubject`).
(
    name: "replaceWord",
    kinds: [TextChange],
    params: {"sort": Any, "from": Default(Any, None), "to": Default(Any, None)},
    body: ReplaceWord(Param(sort), Param(from), Param(to)),
)
